WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Writing a Will sounds complicated — surrounded by legal terms like Probate, Testator, Codicil, and Section 63. It is really just a few simple questions.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
WillDrafting.in — India's First Online Will Drafting Platform.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Step 1: Tell us about you. Enter your full name, date of birth, city, and marital status. Plain questions, 256-bit encrypted, saved automatically.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Step 2: Add your family. Select your spouse, children, and parents so we work out who your legal heirs are.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Step 3: List what you own. Add your flat or house, bank accounts and fixed deposits, mutual funds, and gold jewellery in one assets register.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Step 4: Decide who gets what. Split each asset between your loved ones down to the exact percent until 100% is allocated.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
Step 5: Choose your executor. Pick the trusted person who will carry out your Will, plus a backup executor.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.000
Step 6: Name a guardian for children under 18, and add personal wishes for heirlooms, charity, pet care, or family messages.

00:32.000 --> 00:36.000
Automatic Legal Health Check: We scan your answers for gaps before drafting so every asset is allocated and no legal heir is left out.

00:36.000 --> 00:40.000
Drafted for you: Your answers assemble clause by clause into a complete, court-ready Last Will and Testament.

00:40.000 --> 00:44.000
Choose a verification plan: Auto Verified (₹2,490), High Court Advocate Review in Lawyer Verified (₹4,990), or Connect to Lawyer on call (₹9,990).

00:44.000 --> 00:48.000
Last step: Download your Will PDF, print it on plain A4 paper, and sign in front of two adult witnesses.

00:48.000 --> 00:52.000
Answer. Review. Sign. That is your Will, done properly.

00:52.000 --> 00:56.000
Plan with love, protect with Will. Click Start your Will to begin.

00:56.000 --> 01:02.000
WillDrafting.in — India's First Online Will Drafting Platform. Visit www.willdrafting.in.
